to 2326.32, 2326.31 to 2515.30, with the window high 2771 printed on bar 89.", "Bars 90-116 are two-sided: overlapping bodies, highs at 2557.46 (bar 95) and 2609.02 (bar 113), lows clustered 2357.18-2425.44; bar 110 spiked to 2680 and closed 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 \u2014 the first consecutive closes above the 2557.46 ceiling; bar 117 has open 2446.22, high 2643.52, low 2436.87, range 206.65, closing in its top quarter; bar 118 reaches 2700.", "Bar 119 (open 2632.98, high 2645.88, low 2568.16, close 2642.90) is a 77.72-range bar closing near its high while holding above the range ceiling; it makes a lower high than bar 118 (2645.88 vs 2700).", "Recent lows rise: 2357.18 (bar 101), 2358.62 (bar 114), 2370.54 (bar 115), 2413.82 (bar 116), 2436.87 (bar 117), 2568.16 (bar 119).", "Price 2642.90 remains below the bar-89 spike high 2771, so the post-spike section is not yet a confirmed new-high trend."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: a run of lower highs and lower lows from 2116.86 (first open) to 1368.42 (bar 13 low), with widening ranges into bars 9-13 (2006.06->1859.02, 1859.01->1813.04, 1813.04->1731.00, 1731.00->1581.32, 1581.32->1568.55).", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1779580800000, "upper_boundary": "2139.34"}, {"description": "Selling climax / possible mtr-like low area: bar 13 prints the window low 1368.42 with its close 1568.55 well above that low, and bar 14 reverses to close 1687.83 near its high (high 1690.78) after opening 1568.55.", "end_time_ms": 1780790400000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780617600000, "upper_boundary": "1690.78"}, {"description": "Bull sequence from the window low: rising swing lows 1512.91/1533.12, 1821.49, 2357.18, 2358.62 punctuated by consolidations (about 1512-1725, 1850-1975, 2357-2557); successive bull legs reached 1954.36 (bar 59) and 2771 (bar 89).", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Two-sided trading range after the bar-87..89 spike: overlapping bars between the 2357.18 low (bar 101) and the 2557.46 high (bar 95), with two upside probes that closed back inside \u2014 2680 high closing 2514.72 (bar 110) and 2609.02 high closing 2514.07 (bar 113).", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Upside breakout attempt from that range: bars 117-119 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, the first closes above the 2557.46 ceiling, with bar 118 printing 2700, the highest high since the 2771 spike of bar 89.", "end_time_ms": 1789948799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789603200000, "upper_boundary": "2700"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Continuation: additional closes above 2700 with rising closes would indicate acceptance above the range, shifting focus to the 2771 bar-89 spike high.", "Failure: closes back below 2568.16 (bar 119 low) and then 2557.46 would indicate a failed breakout and a return into the 2357.18-2557.46 range.", "A close below 2357.18 would remove the two-sided floor and support a broader range-breakdown or bear-leg read.", "Repeated closes between 2557.46 and 2700 without progress would mark a new, higher trading range rather than a continuation trend."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1789963199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["Since 1789488000000 the sequence of higher highs and higher lows is unbroken for 33 bars with no close below a prior swing low, which is a genuine bull-trend signature, not a range leg.", "Two consecutive large bull bars (1789732800000 range 89.68, 1789747200000 range 65.08) closed near their highs and produced immediate follow-through to 2658.79, i.e. accepted breakout rather than failed probe.", "The 2569.80 pullback low (1789862400000) held above the breakout base, and the last three bars are consecutive higher closes 2611.00, 2631.93, 2642.90, 2664.73, so sellers have not regained control of the leg.", "The 2358.62 low matched the 2357.18 low 76 bars earlier, giving a double bottom that can support a trend reversal rather than just a range boundary."], "evidence_for": ["Both extremes of the window are defended rather than one-sided: 2357-2391 is visited repeatedly in the first 14 bars and again near 2358-2425 at 1789488000000, while 2643-2700 is tested twice late in the window.", "The 2700.00 top was rejected twice at the identical price, and earlier rally highs show the same selling pattern (2680.00 at 1789128000000, 2609.02 at 1789416000000).", "The final bar stalls exactly at the prior 2700.00 high and closes 2664.73, still inside the 2357.18-2700.00 range, so no boundary has been accepted.", "Since 1789488000000 the advance is built from 2-5 bar pullbacks and overlapping bars, which is channel behaviour inside a range rather than a spike with immediate acceptance."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window spans 120 closed H4 bars from open_time 1788235200000 to close_time 1789963199999: first open 2471.35, final close 2664.73.", "Range extremes: low 2357.18 (bar 1788336000000) and low 2358.62 (bar 1789488000000) form a near-identical double bottom; high 2700.00 was printed twice, on bar 1789804800000 and again on the final bar 1789948800000.", "Last leg runs 2358.62 (1789488000000) to 2700.00 (1789948800000), about +14.5% over 33 bars, with rising swing lows 2370.54, 2436.87, 2469.24, 2495.82, 2569.80, 2641.70.", "Deepest pullback of that leg: high 2658.79 (1789833600000) to low 2569.80 (1789862400000), about -3.3%, holding well above the 2495.82 low.", "Earlier impulse highs left long upper tails: bar 1789128000000 O2457.12 H2680.00 C2555.52 (tail 124.48) and bar 1789416000000 H2609.02 C2514.07 (tail 94.95).", "Bars 1789732800000 (O2507.15 C2578.60, range 89.68) and 1789747200000 (O2579.97 C2636.28, range 65.08) closed above the 2469.28-2544.63 consolidation and were followed through to 2658.79.", "Bar 1789804800000 tagged 2700.00 and closed 2638.49, 61.51 off the high, the first rejection of that level.", "Final bar 1789948800000 O2642.90 H2700.00 L2641.70 C2664.73: bull body with close in the upper third, but the close sits 35.27 below the 2700.00 range top instead of above it."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Broad two-sided range covering most of the window: defended base 2357.18/2358.62 (double bottom) against a top zone 2680.00-2700.00, with repeated full traversals and heavy bar overlap between the extremes.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1788336000000, "upper_boundary": "2700.00"}, {"description": "Bull leg/channel from the 2358.62 low (1789488000000) to the 2700.00 high (1789948800000): rising swing lows 2370.54, 2436.87, 2469.24, 2495.82, 2569.80, 2641.70, separated by 2-5 bar pullbacks and overlapping bars rather than a vertical spike.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2700.00"}, {"description": "Breakout above the 2469.28-2544.63 consolidation by two consecutive large bull bars (1789732800000 range 89.68; 1789747200000 range 65.08) with follow-through to the 2658.79 high (1789833600000), then a pullback that held the 2569.80 higher low.", "end_time_ms": 1789862399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2544.63", "start_time_ms": 1789732800000, "upper_boundary": "2658.79"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2700.00 followed by another close above 2700.00 would show acceptance of a breakout from the 2357.18-2700.00 range and shift the read toward a bull-trend/breakout phase.", "A bear reversal bar touching 2700.00 and closing back below 2641.70, or two consecutive closes below 2600.00, would keep the range-top test valid and point to rotation back toward 2569.80, then 2495.82.", "A closing break below 2569.80 would break the most recent higher low of the current leg and mark a transition back to two-sided rotation.", "Continued higher lows above 2641.70 with overlapping bars would sustain the channel read while leaving the 2700.00 boundary unresolved."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2399.7", "close_time_ms": 1789549199999, "high": "2400.01", "low": "2384.56", "open": "2395.73", "open_time_ms": 1789545600000, "volume": "2199572.15"}, {"close": "2404.73", "close_time_ms": 1789552799999, "high": "2405.77", "low": "2398.3", "open": "2399.7", "open_time_ms": 1789549200000, "volume": "1385367.542"}, {"close": "2403.79", "close_time_ms": 1789556399999, "high": "2405.87", "low": "2398.5", "open": "2404.73", "open_time_ms": 1789552800000, "volume": "1493684.845"}, {"close": "2421.43", "close_time_ms": 1789559999999, "high": "2425.53", "low": "2401.96", "open": "2403.65", "open_time_ms": 1789556400000, "volume": "2059806.861"}, {"close": "2405.67", "close_time_ms": 1789563599999, "high": "2421.71", "low": "2402.32", "open": "2421.43", "open_time_ms": 1789560000000, "volume": "2315163.628"}, {"close": "2393.1", "close_time_ms": 1789567199999, "high": "2405.74", "low": "2391.94", "open": "2405.65", "open_time_ms": 1789563600000, "volume": "2323332.147"}, {"close": "2387.35", "close_time_ms": 1789570799999, "high": "2396.73", "low": "2384.32", "open": "2393.1", "open_time_ms": 17